<h2 style="font-size: 28px; color: #1565c0; margin-top: 30px;">Examination Overview: NISM 24 AML and CFT Provisions in Securities Markets Certification</h2>

<p style="color: #000; margin-top: 10px; text-align: justify;">
In an increasingly complex global financial ecosystem, safeguarding the integrity of the capital markets is of paramount importance. Regulatory bodies worldwide are continuously tightening measures to prevent financial crimes, making Anti-Money Laundering (AML), Combating the Financing of Terrorism (CFT), and the prevention of Proliferation Financing (PF) critical compliance pillars for every financial intermediary.

<br><br>

